<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="yellow">Photosynthetic Skin</ansi> mutation

A verdant tinge spreads beneath your skin as chloroplast-like
organelles take root. In sunlight you heal; in darkness, the hunger
gnaws.

<ansi fg="yellow">Type:</ansi>     Passive
<ansi fg="yellow">Rarity:</ansi>   Rare

<ansi fg="yellow">Benefits:</ansi>
  Significantly faster health regeneration when in lit areas —
  sunlight and ambient light feed your recovery

<ansi fg="yellow">Drawbacks:</ansi>
  Moderately reduced willpower — the metabolic demands of
  photosynthesis dull your mental edge

